135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (It is more than an occasion to drink tea. With a fine pot of tea and a quiet space, we invite participants to pause, set aside distractions and bring their attention back to their bodies and inner selves.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (Here, aged tea is both a drink and a way to spend time with yourself. Sip attentively and notice your own experience: the warmth, aroma and lingering sweetness of the tea, and any feelings of warmth, ease, relaxation or other sensations in your body.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
