139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (In a quiet setting, with careful brewing and guidance, participants are invited to notice more than the colour, aroma and taste. The experience encourages awareness of the subtle bodily sensations traditionally described as tea qi. Through quiet time with aged tea, the aim is to settle the mind and cultivate awareness. The traditional description also expresses the belief that this experience may support general well-being; it should not be understood as a medical claim.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
