152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (We believe good tea deserves good water. The mineral composition, taste and condition of the water can change how a tea presents itself.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (The gathering uses natural BRT glacial spring water sourced from an altitude above 4,700 metres. It contains minerals and trace elements including strontium, selenium, calcium and iron. Its clean, gently sweet taste is intended to bring out the character of the aged tea.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 53 0 R
/T (Q6 How long does a gathering last?)
/E (Q6 How long does a gathering last?)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (Depending on the theme, it usually lasts about 1.5 to 2 hours. We leave enough time to slow down, drink tea quietly, notice how you feel and share reflections at a comfortable pace.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
