>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (We focus on small gatherings by reservation so that each participant can enjoy the experience. Options include individual sessions, small private gatherings, corporate events, group experiences and tailored sessions. Larger events can be discussed according to the venue and theme.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
158 0 obj
<<
