/K [12]
>>
endobj
159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 53 0 R
/E (Yes. We can tailor a gathering for birthdays, gatherings with friends, private tea conversations, business hospitality, corporate events, team experiences, cultural exchanges and VIP sessions. We will plan the tea setting and programme around the group size, timing and purpose.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
