/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (This is a tea culture and lifestyle experience, not a medical service. It does not replace professional medical advice or treatment. People have different health conditions and may respond differently to tea. Please let us know in advance if you have a particular health concern. We encourage everyone to listen to their body and choose what suits them.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
