endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (No special preparation is needed. We recommend comfortable, loose cotton tops and long trousers. Avoid attending immediately after a heavy meal or drinking alcohol. Before the session, please avoid pungent or strongly flavoured foods such as onion, ginger, garlic and curry, and avoid perfume.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
170 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
